{"channelId":"UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","row":["BJC Health",17300,"Many practices consist simply of individual practitioners in a common office.\n\nBJC Health is different – our specialists and allied health professionals work together to ensure that your diagnosis is thorough and that related conditions are also looked after.\n\nAn in-house administration team also means that it’s easy to talk to us and ensures information about your progress is well kept, even across sites.\n\nWe call this holistic approach, Connected Care.\n\nWhether you are referred to our specialists by a GP or you meet our allied health professionals via a walk-in visit, we’ll coordinate our expertise to offer the care most relevant to you.\n\nIf you require any further information, call one of our friendly Receptionists on 1300 252 698 or book online at www.bjchealth.com.au","","Australia"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:02.502Z","channelId":"UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"4cb067592d5d2f4a99a8b85a3dbf6a6a8f7ac3fc4de18c412041762aecb2be67","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"cacb527997e9d8d1ac501982e295d4d03f38c352c8c1ffc1cc3478ee49cb212d"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:02.502Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":17300,"raw":"17.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyIXbjbXb2iCtxFzB9ahAEw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:02.502Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags